# NEVER commit a .gs to this repo — it is PUBLIC and served by GitHub Pages,
# which would publish the backend source (and anything in it) to the internet.
# IBI_Supervision_Backend.gs stays a LOCAL MIRROR; the live copy lives in the
# Apps Script editor. Same rule that was applied to IBIStockAvailability_GAS.gs
# after `const CEO_PIN` turned out to be readable over HTTP.
*.gs
appsscript.json
